WEBVTT

00:17.142 --> 00:18.643
[cell phone vibrating]

00:18.727 --> 00:21.146
BOSS

00:26.901 --> 00:27.777
[sighs]

00:34.659 --> 00:35.869
[theme music playing]

00:59.476 --> 01:02.854
BLOODHOUNDS

01:02.937 --> 01:04.856
[goons chatting indistinctly]

01:04.939 --> 01:05.857
[Woo-jin] Fuck.

01:05.940 --> 01:08.109
- [metal clanking]
- [goon 1] Who is this guy?

01:08.693 --> 01:10.153
[Gun-woo groans]

01:10.779 --> 01:12.989
- [tense music playing]
- [Gun-woo exhales sharply]

01:16.117 --> 01:17.660
- [inhales sharply]
- [goon 2] Kill him!

01:18.411 --> 01:19.537
[breathing shallowly]

01:20.121 --> 01:21.247
Get me the address

01:21.331 --> 01:23.541
of the woman who runs the café
in the Seongeun Building.

01:23.625 --> 01:25.126
[indistinct chatter]

01:25.210 --> 01:26.252
[exhales sharply]

01:28.505 --> 01:30.131
[all grunting]

01:32.050 --> 01:33.051
[Woo-jin grunts]

01:33.134 --> 01:34.969
- [Gun-woo grunting]
- [goons groaning]

01:36.554 --> 01:37.472
[winces]

01:38.640 --> 01:39.974
[grunting]

01:40.058 --> 01:42.018
[Woo-jin grunting]

01:45.355 --> 01:46.439
[grunts, groans]

01:49.734 --> 01:51.152
[inhales, exhales sharply]

01:52.654 --> 01:54.155
[goon 3] Come here, you son of a bitch!

01:54.656 --> 01:55.573
Come on.

01:55.657 --> 01:57.450
Damn you, you fuck nuggets, man!

01:58.201 --> 01:59.244
[yells]

01:59.327 --> 02:00.954
[Woo-jin grunting]

02:03.915 --> 02:05.166
[grunts, groans]

02:08.044 --> 02:09.170
[grunts]

02:14.217 --> 02:15.760
[Woo-jin grunting]

02:18.555 --> 02:20.807
[shouting]

02:20.890 --> 02:22.475
[goon 3] We've got them!

02:22.559 --> 02:23.476
[grunting]

02:24.894 --> 02:25.728
[grunts]

02:31.067 --> 02:32.277
[both grunt]

02:33.153 --> 02:34.988
- [Woo-jin grunting]
- [goons groaning]

02:37.866 --> 02:39.993
[Woo-jin groaning]

02:41.035 --> 02:42.162
[screams]

02:42.245 --> 02:43.663
Goddammit!

02:44.330 --> 02:45.582
[goons grunting]

02:47.417 --> 02:48.585
You sons of bitches!

02:49.169 --> 02:50.253
[goon 4] Come here!

02:52.255 --> 02:54.257
- [Woo-jin shouts, grunts]
- [goon 5] Get down!

02:54.883 --> 02:55.758
[grunts]

03:01.931 --> 03:02.974
[music intensifies]

03:07.437 --> 03:08.313
[Woo-jin yells]

03:14.861 --> 03:15.778
[goon 6] Fuck him up!

03:15.862 --> 03:17.989
- [goons grunting]
- [Woo-jin groaning]

03:21.242 --> 03:22.118
[grunts, shouts]

03:27.582 --> 03:28.625
[goon 7] You little bitch!

03:31.127 --> 03:31.961
You bastard!

03:32.837 --> 03:34.923
[grunting, exhales sharply]

03:37.926 --> 03:39.052
[groans]

03:40.220 --> 03:41.304
[shouting]

03:48.436 --> 03:49.729
[shouting]

03:49.812 --> 03:51.356
[shouting]

03:51.439 --> 03:52.482
[yells]

03:52.565 --> 03:54.567
- [goon 8] Motherfuckers.
- [goon 9] Sons of bitches!

03:55.443 --> 03:57.111
[panting]

03:57.654 --> 03:58.488
[grunts]

04:00.949 --> 04:02.617
[uptempo rock music playing]

04:06.120 --> 04:07.372
[groaning]

04:09.415 --> 04:11.167
[shouting]

04:18.258 --> 04:19.425
- [Hyeon-ju grunts]
- [yells]

04:29.352 --> 04:30.603
[Hyeon-ju grunts]

04:37.652 --> 04:38.987
[groaning]

04:42.615 --> 04:43.616
[panting]

04:43.700 --> 04:45.368
- [grunts]
- [Hyeon-ju groans]

04:53.251 --> 04:54.168
[exhales sharply]

04:54.711 --> 04:56.129
[Hyeon-ju grunting]

04:59.048 --> 05:01.050
[Gun-woo and Woo-jin grunting]

05:03.970 --> 05:04.804
[shouts]

05:10.685 --> 05:11.602
[exhales sharply]

05:17.191 --> 05:18.318
[rock music ends]

05:18.401 --> 05:20.069
[all panting]

05:21.404 --> 05:23.072
- Let's go.
- [Gun-woo] Okay.

05:23.698 --> 05:25.116
- [Woo-jin] Come on!
- [Gun-woo] Right.

05:29.120 --> 05:30.580
Thanks for coming, Hyeon-ju.

05:33.541 --> 05:35.001
You saved us quite a beating.

05:37.253 --> 05:38.212
God, that hurts.

05:48.598 --> 05:50.016
[ominous music playing]

05:52.352 --> 05:53.978
Gun-woo, is that you?

06:05.948 --> 06:07.241
Gun-woo?

06:09.327 --> 06:10.703
- [fabric ripping]
- [gasps]

06:12.872 --> 06:13.915
[breathes shallowly]

06:18.878 --> 06:20.505
- [So-yeon screams]
- [grunts]

06:21.589 --> 06:24.675
- [So-yeon screaming]
- [Jae-myeong] It's all right.

06:25.176 --> 06:27.178
- Shh.
- [muffled screaming]

06:28.763 --> 06:29.639
Hurry up.

06:36.396 --> 06:37.814
[tense music playing]

06:47.865 --> 06:49.117
Hey, hurry up and move.

06:56.249 --> 06:57.125
[man] Hey.

07:04.048 --> 07:06.426
God dammit,
who the fuck is he supposed to be?

07:07.802 --> 07:09.429
[goon 1] You're so fucking annoying.

07:18.938 --> 07:19.772
[groans]

07:20.481 --> 07:22.316
[uptempo electronic music playing]

07:22.400 --> 07:23.568
[screams]

07:25.111 --> 07:26.320
[screams]

07:27.321 --> 07:28.865
Fuck. [grunts]

07:30.283 --> 07:31.159
[screaming]

07:33.995 --> 07:35.163
Shit.

07:39.375 --> 07:40.460
[grunts]

07:44.922 --> 07:45.798
[shouts]

07:48.176 --> 07:49.135
[yells]

07:51.220 --> 07:52.096
[screams]

07:56.392 --> 07:57.977
[panting]

08:01.898 --> 08:03.441
[tense music playing]

08:04.859 --> 08:05.693
Oh, fuck!

08:08.738 --> 08:09.572
[grunts]

08:12.325 --> 08:13.701
[panting]

08:24.462 --> 08:25.505
Fuck!

08:29.759 --> 08:31.385
[Jae-myeong screams, groans]

08:38.100 --> 08:39.977
You fucker! Who are you?

08:41.979 --> 08:43.105
[Jae-myeong groans]

08:48.528 --> 08:49.529
[screams]

08:52.240 --> 08:53.741
[whimpering]

08:54.325 --> 08:56.035
Shut your stupid mouth.

09:01.040 --> 09:03.209
- Get up. Get up!
- [muffled grunting]

09:07.630 --> 09:08.589
[Jae-myeong grunts]

09:14.303 --> 09:15.263
[Jae-myeong yelps]

09:20.434 --> 09:22.186
[Jae-myeong grunting]

09:23.437 --> 09:25.147
[muffled screaming]

09:26.232 --> 09:31.445
[muffled screaming]

09:49.839 --> 09:51.549
[goons chattering indistinctly]

09:52.717 --> 09:53.884
Would you look at that.

09:57.972 --> 09:58.931
Hey.

09:59.932 --> 10:01.017
Who the hell are you?

10:01.767 --> 10:02.935
- Excuse me, sir.
- Hey.

10:04.103 --> 10:05.813
I asked you a fucking question.

10:05.896 --> 10:08.232
[goon groaning]

10:16.866 --> 10:18.159
[man] Sleep tight.

10:19.410 --> 10:20.786
[Woo-jin sighs]

10:21.662 --> 10:23.831
[groaning]

10:25.291 --> 10:26.542
[Woo-jin inhales sharply]

10:27.418 --> 10:29.086
[exhales deeply]

10:30.421 --> 10:31.589
Huh? What the hell?

10:31.672 --> 10:33.883
[exhales] When did I get this?

10:36.510 --> 10:38.387
[groans]

10:38.471 --> 10:41.766
[breathing deeply]

10:42.308 --> 10:43.517
[cell phone vibrating]

10:44.018 --> 10:45.603
MY LOVELY MOM

10:47.688 --> 10:48.648
Yeah, Mom.

10:48.731 --> 10:50.691
[So-yeon] Gun-woo. [exhales deeply]

10:51.400 --> 10:53.736
Mom, what's going on?
What happened? Why are you crying, Mom?

10:53.819 --> 10:55.404
[breathing rapidly]

10:55.488 --> 10:56.989
Someone wants to talk to you.

10:57.073 --> 10:59.075
[dramatic music playing]

11:01.160 --> 11:02.370
Where are you guys right now?

11:20.513 --> 11:21.430
[door opens]

11:22.181 --> 11:23.015
[music ends]

11:26.936 --> 11:29.313
[exhales deeply] Gun-woo, dear.

11:29.397 --> 11:30.314
Hey.

11:33.150 --> 11:35.653
- Mom, what happened to your forehead?
- [whimpers]

11:36.195 --> 11:37.488
It's all right. I just…

11:38.614 --> 11:40.074
I just bumped my head into something.

11:40.157 --> 11:43.160
- [sobbing]
- [exhales deeply]

11:44.036 --> 11:45.663
[gasps] Your face…

11:48.833 --> 11:51.419
What happened?
Woo-jin, what happened to your face?

11:52.044 --> 11:54.213
Oh, uh, it's just a scratch. This…

11:55.047 --> 11:57.842
Mr. Choi's been worried sick
waiting for you.

11:57.925 --> 11:59.301
He's downstairs.

11:59.927 --> 12:00.845
- Okay.
- Okay.

12:04.223 --> 12:05.182
I'll be back.

12:08.728 --> 12:10.563
Come here and sit down!

12:18.195 --> 12:20.698
I'm sure you're all tired,
so I'll keep this short.

12:23.993 --> 12:25.411
When I got your call,

12:26.287 --> 12:28.622
it felt like
the world was crumbling around me.

12:30.249 --> 12:31.792
You are my family.

12:33.502 --> 12:36.130
I was terrified… that I might lose you.

12:37.465 --> 12:39.091
No more dangerous schemes.

12:39.925 --> 12:40.760
Got it?

12:40.843 --> 12:41.969
Let the adults handle it.

12:42.678 --> 12:45.097
- But I… I also want to help.
- [Mr. Choi] Gun-woo.

12:45.681 --> 12:49.685
This here isn't a match
with a winner and a loser.

12:50.644 --> 12:53.272
This is a war
that will only end when someone's dead.

12:54.273 --> 12:55.483
[both sigh]

12:57.693 --> 12:58.903
You two go upstairs.

13:09.914 --> 13:10.748
I'm sorry.

13:10.831 --> 13:13.459
I don't want you to ever get involved
in something like that.

13:14.168 --> 13:15.002
Okay.

13:15.920 --> 13:18.881
Now they know where Gun-woo lives,
so they can't go back there.

13:19.673 --> 13:21.634
Take Gun-woo's mother
to the shelter tomorrow.

13:21.717 --> 13:24.220
For the time being,
it will be safer to stay there.

13:25.638 --> 13:26.472
Okay.

13:28.015 --> 13:28.891
Good night.

13:37.942 --> 13:39.902
What do we do now, Yang-jung?

13:42.738 --> 13:43.864
I can make this end.

13:46.158 --> 13:49.119
It's something we should've already done.

13:50.120 --> 13:51.831
You think you can get Myeong-gil?

13:51.914 --> 13:54.250
I'll get started moving
with Du-yeong tomorrow.

13:55.334 --> 13:56.544
We'll pick them off one by one.

13:56.627 --> 13:58.504
Let's have a meal with Du-yeong.

13:58.587 --> 14:00.339
Uh, Mr. Oh, do me a favor.

14:00.422 --> 14:02.800
Please look into Myeong-gil's men.
Let me know what you find.

14:02.883 --> 14:03.759
Yes, sir.

14:05.970 --> 14:07.263
[exhales deeply]

14:07.763 --> 14:09.098
[dramatic music playing]

14:17.773 --> 14:18.607
[grunts]

14:21.151 --> 14:22.027
[grunts]

14:28.075 --> 14:28.909
[grunts]

14:34.915 --> 14:36.667
[dramatic music playing]

14:51.765 --> 14:52.808
[grunts]

14:56.854 --> 14:57.771
[grunts]

15:01.066 --> 15:01.984
[exhales]

15:04.528 --> 15:05.779
[exhales deeply]

15:07.615 --> 15:08.824
[music ends]

15:33.474 --> 15:34.767
[Myeong-gil] Oh, Mr. Director.

15:34.850 --> 15:36.268
You're here so early in the morning.

15:36.352 --> 15:39.188
It seemed fitting
seeing as how you were coming, Mr. Kim.

15:39.688 --> 15:41.315
I operated on them myself.

15:41.398 --> 15:42.816
Oh, thank you.

15:43.317 --> 15:46.862
One of them had both
of his Achilles tendons cut with a knife.

15:47.529 --> 15:50.950
And the other one had all the tendons
in his shoulders severed.

15:51.533 --> 15:53.535
[ominous music playing]

16:04.004 --> 16:05.589
[Jae-myeong] He had short hair

16:06.757 --> 16:08.133
and slanted eyes.

16:08.217 --> 16:09.385
[suspenseful music playing]

16:09.468 --> 16:11.220
He was quick on his feet.

16:11.929 --> 16:14.181
And he was really good with a knife.

16:15.599 --> 16:16.475
[chuckles softly]

16:18.560 --> 16:19.395
Hm?

16:19.478 --> 16:20.688
Yeah, uh,

16:22.106 --> 16:23.941
I think it was a sashimi knife.

16:26.735 --> 16:28.237
[scoffs] Shit.

16:33.617 --> 16:35.744
Tell Beom
he needs to get to the office by 1:00.

16:35.828 --> 16:37.788
- Let's have a meeting.
- [Jun-min] Yes, sir.

16:38.622 --> 16:41.083
Things just got interesting. [laughs]

16:50.217 --> 16:52.177
- Finish this.
- Oh, okay.

16:54.555 --> 16:56.432
- Sir.
- Yes?

16:58.517 --> 16:59.810
I'm coming with you.

17:01.395 --> 17:02.396
You stay.

17:03.522 --> 17:04.898
I'd like to help you, sir.

17:04.982 --> 17:06.233
Min-dong.

17:07.651 --> 17:09.194
I'll take care of it myself.

17:10.320 --> 17:11.822
You just live your life.

17:12.489 --> 17:15.367
But… I really want to help you out, sir.

17:15.451 --> 17:16.535
Listen,

17:17.077 --> 17:20.330
if I find the restaurant is in ruins
by the time I return to work,

17:20.414 --> 17:21.290
you'll get in trouble.

17:22.291 --> 17:24.752
Keep the restaurant running.
That's how you can help me.

17:25.252 --> 17:26.920
- But still--
- [inhales sharply]

17:29.965 --> 17:30.883
Stay here.

17:31.800 --> 17:33.719
[soft instrumental music playing]

17:37.222 --> 17:38.057
[sighs]

18:07.544 --> 18:09.004
[rock music playing]

18:14.760 --> 18:16.887
[laughing]

18:16.970 --> 18:19.056
[man laughs] Hwang Yang-jung!

18:19.139 --> 18:20.808
It's been so long.

18:20.891 --> 18:22.643
God, why haven't you been in touch?

18:22.726 --> 18:24.103
I was busy making a living.

18:24.937 --> 18:26.897
Man, why has your handsome face
aged so much?

18:26.980 --> 18:28.774
Making an honest living is not easy.

18:28.857 --> 18:29.983
[laughs] Right?

18:30.067 --> 18:31.819
It's hard to do it honestly, no?

18:31.902 --> 18:32.986
[laughs]

18:34.154 --> 18:35.572
- Man, it's so good to see you.
- Yes.

18:36.573 --> 18:39.535
I called Su-cheol and Min-su
to have them look into it.

18:40.035 --> 18:41.370
This is a pretty big deal.

18:42.621 --> 18:45.958
These guys…
aren't your average loan sharks.

18:47.584 --> 18:49.169
- Thank you.
- [Yang-jung] Thanks.

18:52.756 --> 18:53.590
[man exhales]

18:54.174 --> 18:55.843
A friend in Yeouido overheard

18:56.426 --> 18:59.847
Iil Group purchased
an unfinished hotel building in Gangnam.

19:00.597 --> 19:02.432
And they got the cash from Smile Capital.

19:03.016 --> 19:05.477
- Kim Myeong-gil's company, right?
- Yeah.

19:07.020 --> 19:10.315
But why would a corporate magnate borrow
from Kim Myeong-gil? I don't get that?

19:12.151 --> 19:14.111
Well, Myeong-gil probably tricked them.

19:15.612 --> 19:17.156
- Let's find out.
- Mm.

19:18.907 --> 19:19.867
[sighs]

19:20.367 --> 19:22.161
Finally avenging our boys.

19:23.912 --> 19:24.872
Let's end this.

19:25.664 --> 19:27.166
Mr. Choi gave us his approval.

19:27.833 --> 19:29.209
[dramatic music playing]

19:30.002 --> 19:30.836
Mm.

19:31.670 --> 19:36.300
Back in the day, President Choi
had five knifers working for him.

19:36.383 --> 19:39.928
During that time,
he would lend money to corporations,

19:40.012 --> 19:42.431
so he often had
10 billion won or more uncollected.

19:42.514 --> 19:44.558
But places like construction companies

19:45.225 --> 19:47.936
would always have gangs
that would be looking out for them.

19:48.020 --> 19:49.646
That's when these guys would go.

19:49.730 --> 19:53.317
They would go out
and obliterate an entire gang in a day.

19:53.400 --> 19:57.654
Back then, even the big gangs were
terrified of President Choi's knifers.

19:59.656 --> 20:02.409
When I finally got Choi out of the way,

20:03.577 --> 20:05.913
the first thing Beom and I did
was get rid of the knifers.

20:05.996 --> 20:08.248
And do you have an idea
of why we did that?

20:09.583 --> 20:10.500
Uh, no.

20:11.835 --> 20:14.838
Because I was scared as fuck too,
you know?

20:14.922 --> 20:16.965
[all laughing]

20:17.049 --> 20:18.800
You and In-beom took them out alone?

20:18.884 --> 20:23.347
We sent two gangs, one from Sindang-dong
and one from Yeongdeungpo, as a unit.

20:23.430 --> 20:26.266
We were able to do it
because they weren't together at the time.

20:26.350 --> 20:28.602
Otherwise, it would have been impossible.

20:28.685 --> 20:30.520
Wow. That's amazing, sir.

20:30.604 --> 20:31.855
But in the end,

20:33.023 --> 20:35.901
I couldn't get rid of
the two most important ones.

20:36.985 --> 20:40.113
Lee Du-yeong and Hwang Yang-jung.

20:40.697 --> 20:43.742
President Choi's left and right-hand men.

20:45.285 --> 20:50.207
Back when I was President Choi's lackey,
I once had a run-in with Lee Du-yeong.

20:50.290 --> 20:51.166
He's handsome.

20:53.001 --> 20:55.712
This one time,
a gang leader was stuck in traffic,

20:55.796 --> 20:58.090
so he was having a smoke
with his window rolled down.

20:58.173 --> 21:00.968
He heard a motorcycle approaching,
so he turned his head.

21:01.051 --> 21:05.264
And Lee Du-yeong carved his face like this
with a sashimi knife.

21:05.347 --> 21:07.474
Fuck, his mouth was bleeding,
flapping in the wind.

21:07.557 --> 21:09.101
Shit, that's amazing.

21:11.061 --> 21:12.104
Who's Hwang Yang-jung, sir?

21:12.187 --> 21:14.231
Well, they say

21:15.774 --> 21:18.819
that he made cripples
out of 20 gang members

21:18.902 --> 21:20.821
by severing their Achilles tendons solo.

21:20.904 --> 21:24.950
I've also heard he uses two knives at once
and can stab a hundred times in a minute.

21:26.034 --> 21:27.327
Crazy shit.

21:29.288 --> 21:30.539
[chuckles]

21:31.707 --> 21:33.625
Did you say that three kids showed up?

21:33.709 --> 21:36.545
Yes. A girl showed up about halfway.

21:37.045 --> 21:40.215
And I think she's somehow connected
to that bookstore I mentioned to you.

21:40.799 --> 21:41.633
[chuckles]

21:43.302 --> 21:45.637
It would make sense
if Choi owns the bookstore.

21:45.721 --> 21:49.850
That senile fuck must have crawled out
of the shadows to save his kids.

21:49.933 --> 21:51.101
[laughing]

21:52.269 --> 21:54.104
Do you know
how much money President Choi has?

21:55.772 --> 21:59.776
I'd guess, in cash, about 50 billion.

21:59.860 --> 22:03.113
[gasps] That could fully cover the money
we're short on, sir.

22:03.196 --> 22:04.948
[laughing]

22:05.032 --> 22:08.744
Well, I guess
someone up there's looking out for us.

22:08.827 --> 22:10.704
[all laugh]

22:11.455 --> 22:13.957
Jang-do and Beom,
I want you to stake out the place

22:14.041 --> 22:15.250
and bring me everything.

22:20.047 --> 22:22.049
LOVE ORPHANAGE

22:26.094 --> 22:26.928
[Woo-jin groans]

22:28.263 --> 22:29.097
[Gun-woo grunts]

22:30.557 --> 22:31.641
[both] Oh!

22:33.310 --> 22:34.227
Aren't you coming?

22:34.978 --> 22:37.314
I don't want to go in. Make it quick.

22:38.231 --> 22:40.317
Suit yourself. We'll be right back, okay?

22:42.319 --> 22:43.487
[woman] Kids, this way.

22:44.404 --> 22:45.530
Come this way, please.

22:47.908 --> 22:50.202
It's a children's room,
so it's a bit small.

22:50.285 --> 22:52.871
But it should be all right.
Please take your time.

22:52.954 --> 22:53.997
Thank you.

23:05.717 --> 23:07.719
[gentle piano music playing]

23:13.433 --> 23:16.395
[Gun-woo] What do you think, Mom?
There's Woo-jin.

23:16.937 --> 23:18.105
[Woo-jin] Hello, ma'am.

23:19.773 --> 23:20.774
[exhales deeply]

23:23.777 --> 23:27.656
A friend from grade school works for a guy
that works for Kim Myeong-gil,

23:27.739 --> 23:29.783
so he was there
when things went down that day.

23:30.492 --> 23:32.494
From what I heard, it got pretty scary.

23:33.328 --> 23:34.913
They were waiting at the gas station,

23:34.996 --> 23:36.665
and as soon as
that Iil Group heir came in,

23:36.748 --> 23:38.917
they locked him up,
beat him, and threatened to kill him.

23:39.000 --> 23:40.919
[man inhales sharply, exhales]

23:41.002 --> 23:42.462
They must be the only guys in Korea

23:42.546 --> 23:44.464
that would do that
to such a powerful family.

23:44.548 --> 23:46.967
- And?
- And they got a video of the guy…

23:48.385 --> 23:51.096
But like… [sighs]

23:58.061 --> 24:01.148
[Mr. Oh] This is Kim Jun-min,
the sales director at Smile Capital.

24:01.231 --> 24:02.858
He has six priors for fraud.

24:03.608 --> 24:05.277
Used car fraud, credit card payment fraud.

24:05.944 --> 24:07.320
You name it, he's done it.

24:08.071 --> 24:10.991
Apparently, he served
at Seoul Nambu Detention Center.

24:11.992 --> 24:13.034
Im Jang-do.

24:13.118 --> 24:14.953
He was a cadet in training

24:15.495 --> 24:18.039
until he got kicked out
for sexual harassing a junior cadet.

24:18.123 --> 24:18.999
He has no priors,

24:19.082 --> 24:21.460
and he's the company's
head of strategic planning.

24:22.294 --> 24:23.128
That's odd.

24:23.837 --> 24:26.923
Having a guy who understands
exactly how the police operate

24:27.007 --> 24:29.509
would really help them
avoid police investigations.

24:29.593 --> 24:30.719
So, it's these two?

24:31.219 --> 24:32.137
[Mr. Oh] Yes.

24:32.220 --> 24:33.722
You have their addresses?

24:34.389 --> 24:35.891
[Mr. Oh] Well, I have one for this guy.

24:36.600 --> 24:38.101
He lives in Saseong-dong.

24:38.185 --> 24:40.020
We know what car he drives
and the plate number.

24:41.104 --> 24:42.522
We should get the jump on them fast.

24:43.815 --> 24:45.275
They'll definitely catch on soon.

24:45.358 --> 24:46.193
[Yang-jung] Yes.

24:46.860 --> 24:48.987
This one. I'll take him.

24:50.572 --> 24:53.992
- Let's go tomorrow night?
- But how far should we go?

24:54.075 --> 24:56.536
What do you mean how far? Take them out.

24:59.748 --> 25:01.082
I'll take care of Kim Myeong-gil.

25:01.166 --> 25:03.001
There's always someone with him.

25:03.835 --> 25:05.712
And he's good at manipulating.

25:05.795 --> 25:07.422
Make sure
that you and Du-yeong go together.

25:08.757 --> 25:10.091
I can just tail him.

25:12.135 --> 25:14.888
Do you know if there was a really big guy
with Myeong-gil by any chance?

25:14.971 --> 25:16.014
Ah, yes.

25:16.848 --> 25:19.601
The detective agency asked for more time
with that one.

25:20.602 --> 25:22.354
I'll look into it more.

25:23.522 --> 25:24.940
Who is he?

25:25.023 --> 25:28.109
He's the one that threw me out the window,
and he's as strong as an ox.

25:31.863 --> 25:35.116
Sir, what will you do
about the cash in the bookstore?

25:35.700 --> 25:36.952
We have to move it.

25:37.035 --> 25:38.787
This one knows the location.

25:39.287 --> 25:41.748
Why don't we have the kids move the cash?

25:44.501 --> 25:48.505
The thing is, we don't have time,
and we are short on manpower.

25:50.423 --> 25:52.259
Uh, those kids are no joke.

25:52.342 --> 25:55.136
- They mowed down 30 men.
- You saw it?

25:55.220 --> 25:57.347
The men were all down when I got there.

25:57.889 --> 26:00.850
Thirty men without even using knives. Wow.

26:00.934 --> 26:01.935
Well, they're not your--

26:03.311 --> 26:06.940
Sir, it should be fine
if they move it early in the morning.

26:07.023 --> 26:08.567
Why don't you give them a chance?

26:09.150 --> 26:10.527
Hyeon-ju's a smart kid too.

26:17.075 --> 26:19.202
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- [Woo-jin] Okay, put it here.

26:19.286 --> 26:20.245
Ah, yes!

26:20.912 --> 26:21.746
Here.

26:22.956 --> 26:25.834
- One more.
- Oh! Looks amazing.

26:25.917 --> 26:26.751
[So-yeon laughs]

26:27.377 --> 26:28.628
Thank you for the meal!

26:28.712 --> 26:30.005
[Gun-woo] Thank you for the meal.

26:30.088 --> 26:31.590
- Thank you.
- Please enjoy everyone.

26:31.673 --> 26:34.009
- [Gun-woo] Mm.
- [So-yeon] Here you go, Hyeon-ju.

26:34.926 --> 26:36.511
Oh, thank you.

26:36.595 --> 26:38.263
- Oh!
- [Gun-woo] Mm.

26:44.769 --> 26:46.688
Did you use our kimchi to make this?

26:46.771 --> 26:47.606
Uh-huh.

26:48.648 --> 26:51.693
Whoa. It tastes totally different
from when I make it.

26:51.776 --> 26:52.944
[chuckles]

26:53.028 --> 26:55.113
It's not that hard. I can teach you.

26:56.531 --> 26:57.365
Cool.

27:02.787 --> 27:04.998
[So-yeon]
Oh, and I wanted to ask you something

27:05.081 --> 27:09.836
about the… about the orphanage.
Does Mr. Choi control the whole place?

27:10.587 --> 27:12.172
Uh, yes.

27:12.756 --> 27:14.966
According to Grandpa,
he used to be very poor,

27:15.050 --> 27:18.053
so his dream was to help those in need
when he made enough money.

27:18.136 --> 27:19.304
Oh.

27:20.138 --> 27:22.891
So, then are you Mr. Choi's granddaughter?

27:23.475 --> 27:24.476
Uh… Uh, no.

27:25.185 --> 27:28.104
I was placed in the orphanage
when my parents passed away.

27:28.188 --> 27:29.814
Ah, I'm so sorry.

27:30.482 --> 27:32.567
Oh, I shouldn't have brought that up now.

27:33.860 --> 27:34.944
No, it's fine.

27:35.028 --> 27:36.946
Mm, I'm sorry.

27:38.323 --> 27:39.157
Uh…

27:39.741 --> 27:41.618
[So-yeon]
What foods do you like, Hyeon-ju?

27:42.911 --> 27:43.745
Well,

27:45.413 --> 27:47.415
- I really like rolled omelets.
- [Gun-woo grunts]

27:47.499 --> 27:49.959
Oh, then why don't you have some-- [gasps]

27:50.585 --> 27:52.796
Hey, where are the rolled omelets?

27:54.589 --> 27:57.217
My God, you two should have left some
for Hyeon-ju.

27:57.926 --> 27:59.135
[Woo-jin] Uh…

28:00.220 --> 28:01.054
Oh.

28:03.181 --> 28:05.850
That's right. I wanted rolled omelets.

28:07.477 --> 28:08.561
[scoffs]

28:08.645 --> 28:09.479
[chuckles]

28:10.188 --> 28:11.481
I'll make some more. Don't worry.

28:11.564 --> 28:12.565
Oh, no. That's all right.

28:12.649 --> 28:14.901
Oh, no, no. This won't take long.
You just sit tight.

28:14.984 --> 28:16.903
Make a big one, Mom, and make it thick.

28:16.986 --> 28:18.321
All right, then.

28:18.405 --> 28:19.614
- A few.
- [chuckles]

28:19.698 --> 28:21.783
Okay, okay. I'll make them big.

28:24.285 --> 28:25.286
Hurry up and eat.

28:28.373 --> 28:29.457
[cell phone vibrates]

28:30.959 --> 28:31.793
[Gun-woo moans]

28:32.377 --> 28:35.547
THE DAY AFTER TOMORROW GO TO THE BOOKSTORE
AND GET ALL THE CASH OUT

28:38.258 --> 28:39.634
[suspenseful music playing]

28:51.771 --> 28:53.773
KIM JUN-MIN

29:23.928 --> 29:24.929
[Myeong-gil] Take it easy.

29:26.264 --> 29:27.265
[exhales deeply]

29:31.936 --> 29:33.938
[alarm ringing]

29:51.539 --> 29:53.333
- [Woo-jin] Did you pack everything?
- [Hyeon-ju] Yeah.

30:02.342 --> 30:04.052
[tense music playing]

30:09.432 --> 30:10.266
[exhales]

30:25.490 --> 30:26.574
Jesus, man.

30:37.669 --> 30:38.545
[exhales deeply]

30:46.594 --> 30:48.471
- [music intensifies]
- [engine revving]

32:18.603 --> 32:19.479
[music ends]

32:27.695 --> 32:28.905
[Woo-jin exhales deeply]

32:30.031 --> 32:32.075
You two assemble the boxes.
I'll go get the money.

32:32.158 --> 32:34.994
- How are we going to get these to the car?
- We can carry them.

32:35.078 --> 32:37.747
No, that will take too long.
Hyeon-ju, do you have any trolleys?

32:37.830 --> 32:40.458
Uh, go downstairs.
To the left, you'll see a storage room.

32:40.541 --> 32:42.293
Woo-jin and I will get the trolleys.

32:42.377 --> 32:45.338
Arrange the cash on the floor
while we're gone. Let's go.

32:48.007 --> 32:48.883
[Gun-woo grunts]

32:51.886 --> 32:52.762
[lock beeps]

32:57.350 --> 32:58.768
[both panting]

33:03.189 --> 33:04.232
[grunts]

33:11.114 --> 33:12.407
[ominous music playing]

33:36.597 --> 33:38.266
[breathes deeply]

33:40.685 --> 33:41.769
[tense music playing]

33:48.776 --> 33:50.695
[Hyeon-ju grunts, groans]

33:56.659 --> 33:59.078
Oh, you're a tough one.

34:01.831 --> 34:03.082
[panting]

34:11.924 --> 34:13.384
[groans]

34:32.320 --> 34:33.905
[Woo-jin]
Why are you taking your jacket off?

34:33.988 --> 34:35.239
[Gun-woo] Don't let him grab you.

34:35.323 --> 34:37.408
- [Woo-jin] Who is he?
- [Gun-woo] The guy from the café.

34:38.409 --> 34:39.994
[muttering] Fucker.

34:48.336 --> 34:49.837
[music intensifies]

34:54.509 --> 34:56.427
[all grunting]

35:07.563 --> 35:08.689
[Woo-jin shouts]

35:15.279 --> 35:16.114
[screams]

35:16.948 --> 35:18.074
[grunts]

35:22.328 --> 35:24.247
[grunting]

35:27.583 --> 35:28.501
[Gun-woo shouts]

35:29.335 --> 35:31.587
[both screaming]

35:36.717 --> 35:38.427
[laughing]

35:39.053 --> 35:40.680
[both panting]

35:41.764 --> 35:43.766
[cackling]

35:48.980 --> 35:50.273
Hit and duck faster.

35:52.817 --> 35:53.901
[exhales deeply]

36:00.241 --> 36:02.243
[all grunting]

36:12.587 --> 36:13.713
- [grunts]
- [music ends]

36:19.135 --> 36:20.219
[Hyeon-ju panting]

36:22.722 --> 36:24.640
- [Hyeon-ju grunts]
- [Jang-do groans]

36:25.224 --> 36:27.393
[groaning]

36:30.188 --> 36:31.939
[grunting]

36:33.482 --> 36:34.775
You little shit.

36:34.859 --> 36:35.985
[tense music playing]

36:36.068 --> 36:37.320
[panting]

36:41.991 --> 36:43.201
[grunts]

36:47.538 --> 36:48.748
[panting]

36:50.958 --> 36:52.168
[grunts]

36:54.503 --> 36:55.922
- [In-beom grunts]
- [Gun-woo] Low!

36:58.299 --> 36:59.592
[In-beom grunting]

37:03.888 --> 37:05.139
[screams]

37:05.223 --> 37:06.974
[uptempo electronic music playing]

37:07.516 --> 37:09.143
[panting]

37:12.063 --> 37:13.147
[both grunting]

37:15.149 --> 37:17.902
[Jang-do screaming]

37:17.985 --> 37:18.861
Shit.

37:20.863 --> 37:22.657
[both grunting]

37:29.580 --> 37:31.165
[shouts] You bitch!

37:36.629 --> 37:37.964
[Jang-do screams]

37:54.647 --> 37:55.898
[panting]

37:56.482 --> 37:58.359
[Jang-do grunting]

38:00.403 --> 38:01.946
[grunting]

38:10.329 --> 38:11.622
[shouts]

38:16.919 --> 38:18.421
[both straining]

38:19.130 --> 38:20.172
[shouts]

38:21.924 --> 38:23.843
- [music builds, ends]
- [Gun-woo shouts]

38:26.971 --> 38:28.180
[dramatic music playing]

38:28.264 --> 38:29.765
[Hyeon-ju panting]

38:39.025 --> 38:40.109
[exhales deeply]

38:41.360 --> 38:42.653
[groaning]

38:45.197 --> 38:46.657
[shouting]

38:46.741 --> 38:49.410
[both grunting]

38:56.667 --> 38:58.836
[breathing shallowly]

39:08.596 --> 39:11.182
- [Woo-jin] Stop! That's enough.
- [shouts]

39:12.808 --> 39:13.642
[Woo-jin] Calm down.

39:14.393 --> 39:15.603
[Gun-woo exhales deeply]

39:17.021 --> 39:19.148
- [Gun-woo breathing deeply]
- It's okay.

39:20.649 --> 39:21.609
It's over.

39:22.443 --> 39:25.029
It's okay. It's okay.

39:25.696 --> 39:27.698
[both panting]

39:29.200 --> 39:31.410
- We have to tie him up. Okay.
- Yeah.

39:32.828 --> 39:34.455
[uptempo electronic music playing]

39:34.538 --> 39:36.540
- Let's find something to tie him with!
- Okay.

39:40.127 --> 39:42.213
- Hey, go look over there.
- Mm.

39:47.551 --> 39:48.552
Ugh!

39:54.683 --> 39:55.768
Whoa, dude!

39:57.228 --> 39:58.145
Right.

40:01.440 --> 40:02.274
[Gun-woo] Wait.

40:02.358 --> 40:03.401
[Hyeon-ju panting]

40:04.610 --> 40:06.278
Whoa! What happened?

40:06.362 --> 40:07.613
I don't know. I got in a fight.

40:07.696 --> 40:08.572
You okay?

40:08.656 --> 40:10.908
It hurts like a bitch. [groans]

40:10.991 --> 40:14.829
Why did you tie his hands to the front?
That's going to come off easily. [exhales]

40:14.912 --> 40:17.415
- Really? I don't think so.
- So should I re-tie it?

40:17.498 --> 40:19.750
[groans] Just hurry up and tie him.
Go get the trolley.

40:19.834 --> 40:20.668
Okay.

40:21.502 --> 40:22.711
[Woo-jin] Hold his feet.

40:26.006 --> 40:27.967
All right. Let's go.

40:30.094 --> 40:31.971
- [Hyeon-ju] Hurry up, dammit.
- [Gun-woo] Give it.

40:34.765 --> 40:35.641
[door closes]

40:41.105 --> 40:43.607
- Whoa.
- What? I had him cuffed right here.

40:47.278 --> 40:49.280
I guess he got out
since you cuffed him to a pipe.

40:50.030 --> 40:52.199
Looks like you should've
cuffed him properly, Hyeon-ju.

40:52.283 --> 40:53.117
Why you little…

41:01.292 --> 41:02.877
["Sometimes" by Tylynn playing]

41:10.634 --> 41:11.469
[sniffles]

41:11.552 --> 41:12.386
IM JANG-DO

41:12.470 --> 41:16.557
♪ I got this pain deep in… ♪

41:16.640 --> 41:17.641
About time.

41:17.725 --> 41:20.227
We've run into a bit of a problem.

41:20.311 --> 41:21.437
[Myeong-gil] And the money?

41:21.520 --> 41:23.898
Don't worry about that.
The money's still there.

41:23.981 --> 41:25.524
And where are you going?

41:25.608 --> 41:27.193
I couldn't get in touch with In-beom,

41:27.276 --> 41:29.445
and my face is pretty torn up,

41:30.362 --> 41:31.614
so I thought I'd drop by the ER

41:31.697 --> 41:33.032
before going back in.

41:33.115 --> 41:34.283
Did you?

41:34.783 --> 41:36.702
You should clean up your mess first.

41:36.785 --> 41:38.704
Yes, you're right. I should, sir.

41:39.205 --> 41:40.539
But my mouth is bleeding badly,

41:40.623 --> 41:42.458
and my teeth are coming loose,
so I need to go--

41:42.541 --> 41:44.376
Hey, you son of a bitch.

41:44.460 --> 41:47.421
Call Jung, gather his men,
and take them down now.

41:48.464 --> 41:51.884
I want these kids' heads.
Don't you dare just fucking sit there.

41:51.967 --> 41:53.010
You understand?

41:53.552 --> 41:56.972
Before I rip those kids' heads off,
should I chop off yours first?

41:58.140 --> 41:59.225
I understand.

42:00.184 --> 42:01.060
I do, sir.

42:01.143 --> 42:02.603
[ominous music playing]

42:10.903 --> 42:11.737
[chuckles]

42:12.571 --> 42:13.572
[tense music playing]

42:13.656 --> 42:14.698
[goon] Move!

42:16.784 --> 42:18.035
Hurry up, get in.

42:26.585 --> 42:27.586
[music intensifies]

42:28.295 --> 42:29.296
Throw it!

42:40.349 --> 42:41.183
[Woo-jin grunts]

42:41.267 --> 42:42.393
[both panting]

42:44.895 --> 42:46.355
- Pop the trunk.
- Okay.

42:47.314 --> 42:48.148
- Push!
- [grunts]

42:58.117 --> 42:59.493
Careful, careful, careful.

42:59.577 --> 43:00.494
Hurry, hurry.

43:00.995 --> 43:02.871
- There we go.
- [grunting]

43:05.457 --> 43:06.375
Okay, we're done.

43:06.458 --> 43:07.876
Fuck. We have to get the safe.

43:08.502 --> 43:10.879
- Don't we have to hurry up and get going?
- You can go ahead.

43:10.963 --> 43:11.880
How much is in there?

43:11.964 --> 43:13.465
Billions at the very least.

43:14.049 --> 43:14.925
I'm gonna help you.

43:15.426 --> 43:17.386
- Hey, you go ahead.
- Uh…

43:17.469 --> 43:21.307
Dude, bro, there are billions on the line.

43:21.390 --> 43:24.018
Go start the car and wait.
We'll be there before you know it.

43:24.101 --> 43:25.227
You have to hurry.

43:28.772 --> 43:30.608
[Hyeon-ju] There's a bag
underneath the cabinet.

43:30.691 --> 43:31.525
[Woo-jin] Okay.

43:36.071 --> 43:37.740
Oh shit, a gold bar?

43:37.823 --> 43:40.618
- [exhales] Pack it up now!
- Oh.

43:46.415 --> 43:47.416
Dollars?

43:48.751 --> 43:50.878
- Don't just sit there, damn it.
- Got it.

43:53.088 --> 43:54.089
[grunts]

43:57.259 --> 43:58.510
[panting]

44:01.055 --> 44:02.514
[cell phone vibrating]

44:07.394 --> 44:09.396
[phone line ringing]

44:12.524 --> 44:14.151
[ringing continues]

44:15.694 --> 44:16.987
[voicemail] The number you have--

44:20.699 --> 44:23.160
Oh my, you don't look too good.

44:23.243 --> 44:24.662
[laughs] Are you okay?

44:27.623 --> 44:28.582
Let's go.

44:37.716 --> 44:39.593
[breathing deeply]

44:42.763 --> 44:44.056
[Woo-jin] This bag is full.

44:44.139 --> 44:45.516
Why do you have so much money?

44:47.726 --> 44:48.727
Here we go.

44:49.311 --> 44:51.063
Hurry up!

44:51.146 --> 44:52.398
These are really heavy!

44:58.737 --> 44:59.613
Okay.

45:02.074 --> 45:04.618
[Woo-jin grunting]

45:05.786 --> 45:06.704
[Gun-woo] Mm.

45:09.081 --> 45:10.916
[Woo-jin grunts, exhales]

45:14.753 --> 45:17.089
[tires screeching]

45:17.172 --> 45:18.382
[Woo-jin exhales deeply]

45:20.384 --> 45:21.593
[metal clanking]

45:26.640 --> 45:27.850
We need to call Gun-woo.

45:30.561 --> 45:31.395
[cell phone vibrates]

45:31.895 --> 45:32.771
Yeah?

45:33.605 --> 45:34.982
[Hyeon-ju] Stay on my tail.

45:35.482 --> 45:36.316
Uh-huh.

45:38.318 --> 45:40.320
[uptempo electronic music playing]

45:47.745 --> 45:48.871
Oh shit!

45:50.706 --> 45:51.999
Shit!

46:17.733 --> 46:19.443
[Hyeon-ju] Can we go any faster?

46:19.526 --> 46:21.779
I don't think I can.
The car's too weighed down right now.

46:21.862 --> 46:23.530
When I give you the signal, step on it.

46:24.490 --> 46:25.449
Yeah, I'll try.

46:30.370 --> 46:31.705
Okay, now! Go now!

46:31.789 --> 46:33.624
[engine revs]

46:37.795 --> 46:38.670
[grunts]

46:41.173 --> 46:42.174
[exhales]

47:00.692 --> 47:02.069
[both grunting]

47:11.995 --> 47:14.248
[groans, grunts]

47:22.005 --> 47:22.965
Come on, get in.

47:23.465 --> 47:24.967
[tires screeching]

47:38.564 --> 47:40.315
They're coming. Faster! Faster!

47:40.399 --> 47:42.025
I can't. The car is acting up!

47:44.194 --> 47:45.153
Push.

47:49.449 --> 47:50.909
- [grunts]
- [tires screech]

47:50.993 --> 47:52.077
[driver gasps]

47:55.581 --> 47:56.582
[driver] Oh shit!

48:01.545 --> 48:02.963
[music intensifies]

48:13.932 --> 48:15.225
[driver grunts]

48:15.934 --> 48:16.935
Damn it. Hold on!

48:21.773 --> 48:22.733
[Woo-jin grunts]

48:22.816 --> 48:24.693
Hey! Are you okay?

48:24.776 --> 48:26.403
- [Hyeon-ju panting]
- [groaning]

48:26.486 --> 48:27.446
Whoa!

48:31.450 --> 48:32.618
[Hyeon-ju grunts]

48:38.415 --> 48:39.416
[Hyeon-ju grunting]

48:39.499 --> 48:40.542
[grunting]

48:49.426 --> 48:50.969
[tires screeching]

48:51.720 --> 48:53.889
- Oh!
- Here we go!

48:56.808 --> 48:57.851
[both screaming]

48:59.353 --> 49:00.604
[music ends]

49:02.147 --> 49:03.023
[gasps]

49:04.483 --> 49:05.484
[all screaming]

49:06.068 --> 49:07.903
- [Woo-jin grunts]
- [panting]

49:09.988 --> 49:11.782
Push! Push! Push!

49:18.246 --> 49:20.165
More! More! More! More! More! More!\

49:21.416 --> 49:22.334
[screaming]

49:24.503 --> 49:25.504
Hello!

49:30.926 --> 49:32.219
Hey, go to the right!

49:34.972 --> 49:36.181
[engine revving]

49:36.264 --> 49:38.392
More! More! More! More! More! More!

49:42.854 --> 49:44.272
[panting]

49:47.109 --> 49:48.610
Step on it!

49:49.236 --> 49:50.153
[engine stops]

49:50.237 --> 49:51.947
[engine sputtering]

49:52.030 --> 49:54.408
- Ugh, damn it.
- [Hyeon-ju] It's done for.

49:54.491 --> 49:55.409
Damn it.

49:56.243 --> 49:59.204
The car's dead. Get out.
We need to get the bags.

50:01.957 --> 50:03.208
[tense music playing]

50:05.127 --> 50:06.962
[both grunting]

50:07.462 --> 50:08.380
Run!

50:09.631 --> 50:10.799
[both panting]

50:12.884 --> 50:13.885
Run!

50:19.433 --> 50:21.184
[grunting]

50:23.103 --> 50:24.146
[grunts]

50:32.237 --> 50:33.363
[grunts]

50:37.951 --> 50:38.785
Hey!

50:41.705 --> 50:42.706
Run faster!

50:43.457 --> 50:44.791
[theme music playing]

52:36.111 --> 52:37.320
[theme music ends]
